<title>SPAIN: Spain July unemployment 21.84 pct vs June 22.03.</title>
<headline>Spain July unemployment 21.84 pct vs June 22.03.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute</p>
<p>(INE) gave the following monthly figures:</p>
<p> UNEMPLOYMENT			JULY '96     JUNE '96    JULY '95</p>
<p> Total unemployed (million)		3.5	  N.A.	  N.A.</p>
<p> Pct of workforce (pct)	     21.84	22.03	 22.56</p>
<p>NOTE - Data based on INE survey of households (EPA). The labour</p>
<p>ministry publishes separate unemployment figures based on</p>
<p>registered unemployed.</p>
</text>
